- WSL Verilator: seven configurations passed 2,495 completed transactions over
  13,023 checked clocks. Every clock compared all six output words, valid_o,
  and internal a_valid against independent scheduling and exact-integer arithmetic.
- The reference scheduled A independently at T+L+2 and full bundle valid at T+L+4.
  This checks early A timing as well as final data values.

  Case            BASE  E   M   LUTX GRADE RI RN   L   A out  Core LATENCY  Transactions
  combinational   16    3   4   6    1     0  0    0   2      4             359
